{"title":"Camping by the lake","startsAt":"2026-10-10T07:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-12T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Camping at Lake Charles\nA getaway with the full camping vibe — lake views, BBQ, bonfires, kayaking, nature walks and stargazing — but with everyone staying in their own rustic cabin.\n\nWe’ll spend the day relaxing and exploring, then gather around the fire at night for food, drinks, music and good conversation. 🔥💕\n\nPlease note: this is an off-grid experience with limited electricity, no Wi-Fi or drinking water provided, shared washroom facilities, and guests should bring their own bedding and essentials.\n\nCome solo, meet new people, and enjoy a little escape from the city. 💗\n\nPlease DM to reserve a spot. We can car pool as well from longbranch go/Kipling station.\n\nEach Cabin cost $80, 2 person max. ( will share the link to book)","venue":{"name":"195 N Queen St, Etobicoke, ON M9C 4Y1","address":"195 N Queen St, Etobicoke, ON M9C 4Y1, Etobicoke","lat":43.563263,"lng":-79.56638,"city":"Etobicoke"},"fee":null,"group":"The Social Circle ✨","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/5/0/0/highres_536338624.jpeg"}